{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 27, :comments ["<b>When there is among them a medium, etc.</b> Here their death-penalty is stated, and above — excision; witnesses and warning for stoning; intentional without warning by excision; their inadvertent offence is a sin-offering. And so for all those liable to death-penalties where excision is stated of them."], :book :leviticus, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 20, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:07:28.335769943Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}